0.7 TRAP: configs.prism.resolve() IS PACKAGE-ROOT-FIRST
    resolve() tries PRISM/e3_only/<path> BEFORE cwd/<path>. So running
        cd PRISM/e3_only && train_prism --save-dir e3_only/runs/x
    writes to PRISM/e3_only/e3_only/runs/x. THAT is where the e3_only/e3_only/
    nesting came from — it is not a bug, and the v5/v6 runs genuinely live one
    level deeper than prism-no-shadow. Pass --save-dir runs/x from PRISM/e3_only,
    or an absolute path. Related trap: repeated relative `cd e3_only` in a
    persistent shell walks you into e3_only/e3_only/e3_only; use absolute paths.

