VERIFIED CORRECT
  core/inventory.py    absent_class_loss IS exactly -log((1-eta)*sum_S p + eta),
                       via logaddexp, numerically stable, bounded loss and
                       bounded gradient as the paper claims. _NEG_INF = -1e4 is
                       safe ONLY because the loss is forced to fp32.
  model/net.py         clean. SAM normalisation fix present at line 71 behind
                       sam_normalize. shadow_prob IS emitted (line 78).
  core/protobank.py    clean.
